  "edge_schema": "voltmarkt_edge_pat",
  "prompt": "Which 2 products of each category earned the least net revenue in 2025, among the products that sold in 2025? Use the sales rows whose order_date falls in 2025 (order_date is a UTC day). Keep exactly 2 products per category, or every product when a category has fewer than 2. When products tie on revenue, the lower product_id comes first. Return three columns, in this order: category_name, product_id and revenue, the product's 2025 net revenue. Return one row for each product kept. Any row order is fine.",
